                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8972e584-47a6-4db3-9e15-ab5f0832ce9a",
                        "entry_id": "1134d5d2-9df8-3d24-8685-dcbfa4a663d8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "брю́хах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2bd0e669-f27f-30d7-831f-c3e0d6fc7bd1",
                        "entry_id": "1134d5d2-9df8-3d24-8685-dcbfa4a663d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "живот животного"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9709740a-cd1e-46e9-b10f-ab45e8a2e17d",
                                "sense_id": "2bd0e669-f27f-30d7-831f-c3e0d6fc7bd1",
                                "text": "Арбы вязнут, верблюды и волы тонут по брюхо."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9c82293-2d81-4e97-980e-bc8626ecd051",
                                "sense_id": "2bd0e669-f27f-30d7-831f-c3e0d6fc7bd1",
                                "text": "Если обезглавленной лягушке, которая сидит поджавши под брюхо задние ноги, щипнуть последние, то она их тотчас вытянет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb4506d6-2782-4228-a4d1-f922c839a461",
                                "sense_id": "2bd0e669-f27f-30d7-831f-c3e0d6fc7bd1",
                                "text": "Из щели выползала большая жёлтая змея с короткой толстой головой, раздутой шеей, плоским брюхом, со светлым, окаймлённым чёрными линиями рисунком на шейной части, похожим на очки."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a690347-6423-3b35-8347-0ffbf96637fb",
                        "entry_id": "1134d5d2-9df8-3d24-8685-dcbfa4a663d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. живот человека (обычно большой, отвислый)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f76bd640-00ed-46ea-8dc6-ee58aef219cd",
                                "sense_id": "3a690347-6423-3b35-8347-0ffbf96637fb",
                                "text": "И брюхо суёт вперёд: он купец, его не тронь!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74f5d683-aa5d-4b74-a22f-cc7a5989d0dd",
                                "sense_id": "3a690347-6423-3b35-8347-0ffbf96637fb",
                                "text": "Митька отошёл шагов на сто и лёг на брюхо, уперев локти в землю, а подбородок в руки."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d45478be-9eae-4491-9d12-54a6397d7420",
                                "sense_id": "3a690347-6423-3b35-8347-0ffbf96637fb",
                                "text": "Одно скучно — мать у меня такая сердобольная: коли брюха не отрастил да не ешь десять раз на день, она и убивается."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b80dacd2-d18e-43ff-bc87-ab0a8645aadf",
                                "sense_id": "3a690347-6423-3b35-8347-0ffbf96637fb",
                                "text": "На ступеньках восседал громадный длинноволосый бородач с внешностью байкера и соответствующим пивным брюхом."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b69fa27-9501-3fcd-b2b1-72a23df0ac0d",
                        "entry_id": "1134d5d2-9df8-3d24-8685-dcbfa4a663d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. нижняя (обычно выпуклая) часть корпуса самолёта, автомобиля, лодки и т. п.; днище"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdab06e3-6540-4a25-af4a-05c12ac73d8e",
                                "sense_id": "8b69fa27-9501-3fcd-b2b1-72a23df0ac0d",
                                "text": "Передо мной белоголовые мальчишки карабкались по бокам лодки, вытащенной на берег и опрокинутой насмолённым брюхом кверху."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "931b4169-3de6-4b2c-959a-5ed17f82142b",
                        "source_entry_id": "1134d5d2-9df8-3d24-8685-dcbfa4a663d8",
                        "target_lang_word": "belly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "belly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a06d6015-9d28-3add-9045-8586b29d4ee0",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The abdomen (especially a fat one)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02c25212-be3e-4b2c-a06d-0de81c48e502",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d6015-9d28-3add-9045-8586b29d4ee0",
                                                "text": "You've grown a belly over Christmas! Time to join the gym again."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65501443-ed52-3536-b79f-b946913ac807",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "stomach (an organ in animals that stores food in the process of digestion)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9021f365-d2b0-44ed-a366-bac2fb7eea59",
                                                "sense_id": "65501443-ed52-3536-b79f-b946913ac807",
                                                "text": "My belly was full of wine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9145fbe-cf5b-3eec-9a2a-451631bb5f98",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "uterus (a reproductive organ of therian mammals in which the young are conceived and develop until birth)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27d3d52c-813a-4a23-b751-c11fe72bd903",
                                                "sense_id": "d9145fbe-cf5b-3eec-9a2a-451631bb5f98",
                                                "text": "Before I formed thee in the bellie, I knew thee; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f1e8a68-8b1d-3886-963c-0e7bc820fd76",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lower fuselage of an airplane."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bd65cb5-2765-4d49-9d41-e4641c0839c6",
                                                "sense_id": "4f1e8a68-8b1d-3886-963c-0e7bc820fd76",
                                                "text": "There was no heat, and we shivered in the belly of the plane."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f1b3e79-6df2-3d21-8f0a-e997d016521f",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of anything which resembles (either closely or abstractly) the human belly in protuberance or in concavity; often, the fundus (innermost part)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb1864b6-dcca-4d72-9b2e-1855f54320f4",
                                                "sense_id": "0f1b3e79-6df2-3d21-8f0a-e997d016521f",
                                                "text": "the belly of a flask, muscle, violin, sail, or ship"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfca5dd5-0aad-4ebc-94f1-7a5a40258c40",
                                                "sense_id": "0f1b3e79-6df2-3d21-8f0a-e997d016521f",
                                                "text": "[…] I cried by reason of mine affliction vnto the Lord, and hee heard mee; out of the belly of hell cried I, and thou heardest my voyce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a34e13e8-9118-44de-bfcb-243f2f46a721",
                                                "sense_id": "0f1b3e79-6df2-3d21-8f0a-e997d016521f",
                                                "text": "At last I got my knife and cut the halyards. The peak dropped instantly, a great belly of loose canvas floated broad upon the water […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9f1a6b8-995c-3d9c-9309-f7e69b5e50d5",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of anything which resembles (either closely or abstractly) the human belly in protuberance or in concavity; often, the fundus (innermost part).",
                                            "The main curved portion of a knife blade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75b30049-474e-3579-a28e-f7140eba36df",
                                        "entry_id": "d429669d-7910-3ff2-bdf8-28b1f3a258d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of anything which resembles (either closely or abstractly) the human belly in protuberance or in concavity; often, the fundus (innermost part).",
                                            "The hollow part of a curved or bent timber, the convex part of which is the back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
